String {
    key = "mechlopedia.component.125_streak_srm_pack.description"
    text = "Short-range missiles carry less propellant than their long-range counterparts but are far more compact, enabling more missile volleys to be launched than a Long-Range Missile Rack.\n\nThese weapons are common throughout the Inner Sphere and can be found on 'Mechs, tanks, and even turrets."
