    key = "mechlopedia.component.140_large_laser.description"
    text = "Heavy Lasers represent the latest advancement and research in laser weapon technology. Aimed at increasing damage potential while retaining compact size, Heavy Lasers boast the highest damage-to-size ratio of any weapon. The main weakness of the Heavy Lasers is the immense heat output, limiting the number of these weapons that can be carried by any 'Mech."
